### USThing Timetable Service — request tour (.http edition)
###
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the JetBrains HTTP
### client: click "Send Request" above each ### block, top to bottom.
### The login blocks capture tokens into {{token_a}} / {{token_b}} so the
### authenticated blocks below just work.

@base = http://localhost:8001

### 0 · Health
GET {{base}}/healthz

### 1 · Register alice (201 first run; 409 afterwards is fine)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "alice", "password": "alice-pass-1"}

### 2 · Register bob
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "bob", "password": "bob-pass-123"}

### 3 · Login alice -> captures {{token_a}}
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&password=alice-pass-1

> {%
    client.global.set("token_a", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 4 · Login bob -> captures {{token_b}}
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=bob&password=bob-pass-123

> {%
    client.global.set("token_b", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 5 · Wrong password — uniform 401 (same body as unknown user)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&password=nope-nope

### 6 · No token at all -> 401
GET {{base}}/events

### 7 · Create event (alice) — full payload
POST {{base}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "COMP 1021 Lecture",
  "description": "LT-B",
  "location": "Rm 2405",
  "color": "#1e90ff",
  "start_time": "2026-09-26T09:00:00+08:00",
  "end_time": "2026-09-26T10:30:00+08:00"
}

### 8 · Validation: naive datetime -> 422
POST {{base}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "naive", "start_time": "2026-09-26T09:00:00", "end_time": "2026-09-26T10:00:00+08:00"}

### 9 · List (alice) — chronological; copy an id for blocks 10-14
GET {{base}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 10 · Read one (replace the 1 with your id)
GET {{base}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 11 · Missing row -> 404
GET {{base}}/events/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 12 · PATCH partial — only the title changes
PATCH {{base}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Renamed Lecture"}

### 13 · PATCH explicit null — clears the description
PATCH {{base}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"description": null}

### 14 · PATCH end_time before the STORED start_time -> 422 (handler rule)
PATCH {{base}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"end_time": "2026-09-26T08:00:00+08:00"}

### 15 · DELETE -> 204, empty body
DELETE {{base}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 16 · Isolation: bob reading alice's (deleted) event -> 404
GET {{base}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token_b}}

### 17 · Export alice's calendar (raw VCALENDAR in the response pane)
GET {{base}}/events/export.ics
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 18 · Bob's export — contains no VEVENT of alice's
GET {{base}}/events/export.ics
Authorization: Bearer {{token_b}}
